     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The character at index 1, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\"o\"</code>, is replacing the content of variable <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">str</code>. As such, the print statement prints <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\"o\"</code>."
    }
